+  ['Claude','Customer conversations · recurring themes','Customer conversations\n\nPeople want to continue work without repeating the background. They need to see what is collected, when it was captured, and who can access it.\n\nA useful moment\n\nFind a decision from last week and use it in the next conversation.'],
